# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Body (blank line above required): explain the *what* and *why*
#
# Types: feat · fix · docs · style · refactor · perf · test · chore
# Scope: optional – module, component, or ticket ID (e.g. PROJ-123)
# Lines: keep each commit message line at 100 chars or fewer
# Subject: imperative, lowercase, no trailing period
# Revert: revert: <type>(<scope>): <subject>
